-----BEGIN PGP SIGNED MESSAGE-----
Hash: SHA1

Hi,

Roman Rupp schrieb:

Hooray! Floppy Problem is solved, too! :-)
Solution:

Running makedev fd0, then mkdir /media/floppy0,
then adding this line in /etc/fstab:
/dev/fd0	/media/floppy0	auto	rw,noauto,user,sync	0  0
and at last, adding this line in /etc/modules:
floppy

rebooting, floppy is there, to mount and umount, to read and write. :-)

Greetz
Roman
